# What ships is the bundle, the server binary, and the files VS Code reads
# from `contributes`. Everything else is build input.
#
# `node_modules` in particular: esbuild inlines `vscode-languageclient` and its
# dependencies into `dist/extension.js`, so shipping them again would be 315
# files of the same code. `out/` is the tsc build, which exists to typecheck
# and to run the tests — `main` points at the bundle.
.vscode/**
src/**
out/**
dist/**/*.map
node_modules/**
scripts/**
tsconfig.json
**/*.map
**/*.vsix
